From 44a2926500e1536d0df68dee53b830fb57d4b0d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:11:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(smd): drop duplicate CA certificate load in
 group/rfe add

smd.GetClient already loads --cacert into the client it returns, so the
UseCACert calls in "smd group add" and "smd rfe add" read and parsed the
CA file a second time without changing anything.

Add TestSMDAdd_TrustsCACert, which checks that both commands still reach
a TLS server that is trusted only through --cacert. An invalid --cacert
is still rejected with CodePayload (TestCommands_RejectInvalidCACert).

Fixes #191

Signed-off-by: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
